<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    /* 귀여운 구글 폰트 'Gaegu' 불러오기 */
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gaegu:wght@400;700&display=swap');

    .coupon-container {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 40px;
      background-color: #fff9f0;
    }

    .cute-latte-coupon {
      width: 340px;
      font-family: 'Gaegu', cursive;
      /* 귀여운 서체 적용 */
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease-in-out;
    }

    /* 마우스 올리면 통통 튀는 효과 */
    .cute-latte-coupon:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05) rotate(-1deg);
    }

    .deco-top {
      text-align: center;
      background: #ffcc80;
      color: #fff;
      width: fit-content;
      margin: 0 auto;
      /* 음수 마진 제거 */
      padding: 5px 25px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      position: relative;
      top: 15px;
      /* 아래로 살짝 밀어서 카드에 걸치게 함 */
      z-index: 10;
      /* 확실하게 맨 위로 */
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #edb05a;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .main-card {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fffcf5 0%, #f7e8d8 100%);
      border: 4px solid #8d6e63;
      border-radius: 40px;
      padding: 40px 20px 25px;
      /* 상단 패딩을 늘려 deco-top 공간 확보 */
      text-align: center;
      color: #5d4037;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 0 #d7ccc8;
      position: relative;
      /* z-index 기준점이 됨 */
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .shop-title {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #a1887f;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .emoji-wrapper {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .benefit-text {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      margin: 0;
      color: #4e342e;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .sub-msg {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .dotted-line {
      border-top: 3px dotted #8d6e63;
      margin: 20px 0;
      position: relative;
    }

    .center-emoji {
      position: absolute;
      top: -18px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: #fbf2e9;
      padding: 0 10px;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .stamp-grid {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .stamp-icon {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      filter: grayscale(1);
      /* 아직 안 찍힌 도장 */
      opacity: 0.3;
    }

    .stamp-icon.active {
      filter: grayscale(0);
      /* 찍힌 도장 */
      opacity: 1;
      animation: bounce 0.5s infinite alternate;
    }

    .notice {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #8d6e63;
    }

    /* 귀여운 통통 애니메이션 */
    @keyframes bounce {
      from {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      to {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
      }
    }
  </style>
  <title>2026.04.16</title>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="coupon-container">
    <div class="cute-latte-coupon">
      <div class="deco-top">✨ 하나하나 정성껏 ✨</div>

      <div class="main-card">
        <div class="shop-title">HANA CAFE</div>

        <div class="content-box">
          <div class="emoji-wrapper">☕</div>
          <h1 class="benefit-text">라떼 한 잔 선물</h1>
          <p class="sub-msg">당신을 위한 몽글몽글 아트!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dotted-line">
          <span class="center-emoji">🥐</span>
        </div>

        <div class="stamp-section">
          <div class="stamp-grid">
            <span class="stamp-icon active">🤎</span>
            <span class="stamp-icon active">🤎</span>
            <span class="stamp-icon active">🤎</span>
            <span class="stamp-icon">🤍</span>
            <span class="stamp-icon">🤍</span>
          </div>
          <p class="notice">도장 5개를 모으면 아트 라떼가 팡팡!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>
